WEBVTT

00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:40.700
The lionhearted Grand Duke, who has fought for the Holy Kingdom of Ryoza using Touda even if it meant befouling himself,

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:50.660
and the holy Queen, who is the bastion of the people and keeps beast-lords, which feed upon Touda, at her call:

00:01:51.740 --> 00:02:00.620
these two existences have created a dark whirlpool between the two groups of citizenry,

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:04.510
and are about to drag a girl into it.

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:24.590
The injured beast-lord has been brought from the Lazal Beast-Lord Care Center.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:27.340
Damn, that's a big carriage.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:29.730
It's my first time seeing something like that.

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:48.330
Ial and Erin

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:44.970
Although this is for a great cause, it's horrible that it had to be you.

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:00.400
Hurry to the shed!

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:04.510
There was nothing wrong with it last night, was there?

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:08.440
I got here this morning and it looked sluggish.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.700
It looks very languished.

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:17.710
Erin, this is the beast-lord that was carried in yesterday.

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:19.130
Let me see it.

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:20.360
What do you think?

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:25.050
There's nothing wrong with the etch marks on its claws.

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:36.870
The jaw opens, so it's not tetanus.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:42.720
It's so weak that it can't move, so it may have eaten something bad.

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:52.550
Esal-sensei, I smell something sweet on its breath!

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:53.560
A sweet smell?

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:57.550
This scent...  If I remember correctly...

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:03.510
Chichi mimic!

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:05.070
Chichi mimic?

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:08.760
It's a rare grass found only in the Grand Duke's quarter.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:12.570
How could this beast-lord have ingested such a grass?

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:14.580
I don't know.

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:23.130
When I was still small, there was a person who ate a rice cake with some chichi mimic mixed in.

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:32.250
Back then, we got an antidote at a Mist Point from one of the Mist People.

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:39.830
I see, but this is the Queen's quarter, not the Grand Duke's quarter.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:43.190
It would be difficult to meet up with one of the Mist People.

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:53.260
The pharmacy at the capital has all the herbs in this country.

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:56.320
I may be able to get a hold of the antidote there.

00:05:56.320 --> 00:06:02.310
If this beast-lord is suffering from chichi mimic poisoning, it'll probably live for another three days.

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:04.660
No, maybe only two days.

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:10.180
Erin, find that antidote and return by the day after tomorrow.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:14.620
Until then, we'll do our best to get the toxin out of its system.

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:18.450
Leave Lilan to me.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:20.460
Thank you very much.

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:32.670
Raise your head, Shunan.

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:33.240
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.590
How is the Grand Duke doing?

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:43.800
He has been in bed for a while due to a heart illness, but he has calmed down now.

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:46.760
I see.  That's wonderful.

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:52.220
Thank you so much for your concern, Your Highness.

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:06.390
Don't draw it, Ial.

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:09.200
Kyle.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:12.050
Did you find anything out?

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:15.580
That case of Touda egg-stealers I took over from you...

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:18.430
It's starting to link to an unexpected place.

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:19.790
"Unexpected place?"

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:25.650
Only the Touda breeders are allowed to go on egg hunts.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:30.090
But there are those who are smuggling them into the Queen's quarter.

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:32.140
"Into the Queen's quarter?"

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:41.460
And someone has seen a guy in a mask come out of the house of the middleman.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:46.720
Masked, huh?

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:09.100
Ial!

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:24.400
Are the masked guys the Saigamul who're after the Queen?

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:29.030
If so, what are they up to with Touda eggs?

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:32.520
Seimiya-sama!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:37.700
We have trouble.  Your personal attendant, Nami-sama, has become ill!

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:39.380
Nami has?!

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:51.580
Nami!  Nami!

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:53.760
Answer me!  It's Seimiya!

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:59.320
It happened the moment she ate one of the snacks sent to Seimiya-sama by a Ryoza citizen.

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:01.400
Are these the ones?

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:02.170
Yes.

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:06.050
It has a sweet smell.  Is this how this snack should smell?

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:07.100
This scent!

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.200
It's chichi mimic.

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.450
"Chichi mimic?"

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:15.160
It's a poisonous grass that grows only in the Grand Duke's quarter.

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:20.660
A similar thing happened at our palace once before.

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:29.130
There was a time when chichi mimic was mixed into the gifts that were supposed to be sent to the Queen.

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.220
The Saigamul.

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:42.600
They keep coming after the Queen's life.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:47.790
Their objective is to make the Grand Duke the King of this country.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:02.100
You must be seeing it as something that my father or myself plotted.

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:05.580
To give you my honest opinion.

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:10.600
But if you are a Saigamul, you would never do anything which would diminish the Grand Duke's honor.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:19.080
As such, it makes me feel there's someone out there trying to make this look like an act of the Saigamul.

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:30.240
But it makes no difference, as the Queen's and Seimiya-sama's lives are in danger.

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:37.950
Shunan, please!  Save Nami!

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:40.390
Seimiya-sama.

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:43.710
Shunan-sama is not familiar with the capital.

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:46.910
We Sezans will search for the antidote.

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:50.190
Yes.  Please do, Ial.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:52.230
As you command.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:57.850
An antidote for chichi mimic?

00:10:57.850 --> 00:10:58.380
Yes.

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:01.860
Chichi mimic is a poisonous grass only found in the Grand Duke's quarter.

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:05.180
None of the pharmacies around here have it.

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:07.760
I see.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:13.110
Maybe the one just outside of the capital might have it.

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:17.020
Okay!  I'll try going there.

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:18.770
Thank you very much.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:25.540
It's no good.  It's not accepting anything.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:29.280
At this rate, it may not last until tomorrow morning.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.660
Erin.  Please hurry.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.460
They're Sezans.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:47.140
They must be out searching for the antidote.

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:50.810
I can't let them get in my way.

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:58.720
I'm so sleepy from traveling since morning.

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:02.270
I'm sorry, Nukku-san.  Can you keep it up just a bit more?

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:04.270
Yeah!  Leave it to me!

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:08.330
If it's a request from you, I will work all night long!

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:09.910
I'll work hard, too!

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:11.720
You were sleeping all this time!

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:12.420
No, I wasn't!

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:12.970
Stop lying!

00:12:12.970 --> 00:12:14.090
I was only deep in thought!
Stop lying!

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:14.330
I was only deep in thought!

00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:17.340
Chichi mimic?

00:12:18.310 --> 00:12:19.710
I have money.

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:23.330
I'll take it all, including any antidote.

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:24.300
Everything?

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:27.880
Give me a moment.  I think I have some stock in the back, too.

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:36.940
You are...!

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:50.670
Wait!

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:58.050
Hey, isn't he...

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:02.140
Ial-san.

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:05.370
Are you all right?

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:06.780
I'm a Sezan.

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:08.620
What did that man come here for?

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:10.630
He wanted all the chichi mimic and any antidote I might have for it.

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:11.540
Ial-san!
He wanted all the chichi mimic and any antidote I might have for it.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:11.550
He wanted all the chichi mimic and any antidote I might have for it.

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:15.050
Did something happen?

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:21.990
Who are you?

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:24.730
I'm...

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:25.280
You're mistaken.
I'm...

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:26.240
You're mistaken.

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:28.770
I'm sorry about the trouble.

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:29.790
I'm fine.

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:32.570
Did he forget about you?

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:33.920
He's heartless.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:50.880
What you're searching for is a root called tsurigane aoi,

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:54.590
but I can't tell what's gone where with this mess.

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:58.100
We have to find it through all this?

00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:01.150
All the grasses look the same to me.

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:09.920
Excuse me, but is tsurigane aoi one of these two?

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:11.800
Yeah, it's that.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.580
I'm surprised you could tell.

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:17.620
They both smelled similar to the antidote.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.330
You're amazing, Erin-chan!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.990
Why are you looking for that herb?

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:27.400
A beast-lord has been poisoned.

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:32.590
The beast-lord we took in for treatment from Lazal suddenly became in agony from pain.

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:36.380
We don't know where the poison came in from, though.

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:39.770
Poison...

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:44.060
A masked guy after the antidote...

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:50.490
We can't let that beast-lord die.

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:52.950
Yes.

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:56.710
I'm sure someone made the beast-lord take the poison.

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:00.910
And the antidote is being targeted as well.

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:04.210
It'll be dangerous to take the antidote as it is.

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:13.670
Be careful on your way back.

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:16.300
A-A-A-All right, let's hurry and take the medicine back!

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:18.970
W-W-W-We will get this back for sure!

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:40.980
N-N-Nothing to be scared of.

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:42.750
I-I-I'm totally okay!

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:01.900
They're here!

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:07.980
I can't let you guys go any further.

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:21.370
Who's there?!

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:29.170
Let's hear a story from you, Saigamul.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:31.830
That won't be possible.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:32.710
What?

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.500
You won't catch me.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.150
He's dead.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:47.760
Yet another poison, huh?

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:59.330
Why are you, a Sezan, coming with me?

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:02.290
The beast-lord is the symbol of the Queen.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:07.040
If the world finds out that the symbol has been poisoned to death,

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:10.370
many rumors will fly, and only lead to blemishing her authority.

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:14.260
Someone poisoned a beast-lord for something like that?

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:18.500
It may be a trivial motivation to you,

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:20.520
but it's a crisis for this country.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:26.010
And we Sezans exist to protect the Queen.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:31.470
Ial-san.

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:37.440
Why do people bring beasts into our world, for their own purposes?

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:42.660
Beasts don't live for humans.

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:14.110
The beast-lords must be very special to you.

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:17.280
I definitely don't want to let it die!

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.170
What's the matter?

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:28.540
The bridge ahead collapsed.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.620
It's impossible to cross with a carriage.

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:34.210
You'll have to go back to the capital and take a different route.

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:37.380
We won't get there in time if we turn around.

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:38.650
What should we do?

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:42.430
If it's just people, there's a suspension bridge over there.

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:55.370
Are you all right?

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:56.340
Yes.

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:12.840
The bird is...

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:14.510
What's wrong?

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:19.210
There must be a nest over there, but it can't go back to it.

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.330
Get down.

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:57.810
It's okay now, Erin.

00:19:58.970 --> 00:20:00.300
We'll hurry to Kazalm.

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:03.640
Right!

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:22.270
You actually remembered my name.

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:26.450
You'd be at risk if people find out that you're connected to a Sezan.

00:20:26.930 --> 00:20:29.000
That's why I pretended to not know you.

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:32.830
I apologize.

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:34.290
It's fine.

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:47.410
Ah, it's Erin-chan!

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:48.220
Erin!

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:48.970
Little girl!

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:51.170
Did you get the antidote?

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:52.960
Yes.  How's the beast-lord doing?

00:20:53.510 --> 00:20:58.100
Thanks to Esal-sensei and the other teachers getting some of the toxins out, it's still alive.

00:20:58.100 --> 00:20:59.400
Really?

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.350
Y-You're the Sezan-

00:21:01.350 --> 00:21:02.900
Hurry to the beast-lord.

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:06.200
Of course.  Ial-san, thank you so very much.

00:21:09.190 --> 00:21:11.120
Looks like we made it in time.

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:13.330
We should head over, too.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:14.190
We should.

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:25.530
I think I've seen that teacher somewhere.

00:21:33.840 --> 00:21:35.900
She should be fine now.

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:41.860
I'm sorry for making you worry, Your Highness, Seimiya-sama.

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:43.480
Nami.

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:55.600
Looks like it recovered.

00:21:55.600 --> 00:21:56.480
Yes.

00:22:02.660 --> 00:22:05.040
Yay!  We did it!

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:06.290
It's saved!

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:07.550
Yay!  Yay!

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:08.890
Yay!

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:13.210
Erin and Ial.

00:22:13.880 --> 00:22:19.640
With their work, the poisoning incident that happened at Kazalm and the palace came to a close.

00:22:20.870 --> 00:22:28.100
However, the poison that's eroding this country is silently spreading.

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:04.170
Lilan, listen up.

00:24:04.170 --> 00:24:11.760
The name of injured beast-lord that was brought to Kazalm is Eku.

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:13.680
It means "male."

00:24:14.100 --> 00:24:15.560
Are you interested?

00:24:15.890 --> 00:24:20.810
Once Eku gets well, make sure to be his playmate.

00:24:21.460 --> 00:24:25.090
Kemono no Souja Erin.  New Life.

00:24:25.090 --> 00:26:00.070
New Life
